    "title": "Madelaine Petsch Stuns in Floor-Length Gown at 'Maintenance Required' Screening in L.A. - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Just Jared ,\n1 days ago Madelaine Petsch looks stunning in a floor-length Fendi gown for a special screening of her new movie Maintenance Required .\nThe 31-year-old actress attended the Los Angeles screening Monday (October 6) at the All Season Brewing Company.\nHere’s the synopsis: “Charlie, the fiercely independent owner of an all-female mechanic shop, is forced to reevaluate her future when a flashy corporate competitor moves in across the street. Seeking comfort, she turns to an anonymous online confidant – unaware she’s confiding in Beau, the very rival threatening her business. As sparks fly both online and off, the truth threatens to blow everything apart.”\nMadelaine stars as Charlie, while Bad Boys for Life star Jacob Scipio plays Beau.\nThe film also stars Katy O’Brian of Love Lies Bleeding fame, Matteo Lane , Inanna Sarkis , and Louis Delavenne , who were all in attendance at the screening alongside director Lacey Uhlemeyer .\nMaintenance Required premieres globally on Prime Video on October 8. Watch the official trailer right here!\nBrowse through the gallery for more photos from the premiere…\n1",
